 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Ice Formation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>When you reach 6th level, you have learned how to unleash thick layers of ice through the mist. As an action for 4 cursed energy, you can send a cloud of freezing mist to a spot within 60 feet of you. Every creature in a 30-foot radius sphere in that spot must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 6d8 cold damage and are restrained by an ice layer. On a success, they take half as much damage and are not restrained.<br />\n The creature can make a Strength saving throw at the beginning of its turns to break the ice and end the restrained condition.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
